WEBVTT

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.136
Savladao sam njegovu elitnu stražu,

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.095
upao sam u njegov tajni bunker

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:33.936
sa puškom na gotovs.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.856
On se baca po svoj luger.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.696
Izbijam mu ga iz ruke.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.056
Baca se na pilulu cijanida.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.816
Izbijam mu je iz ruke.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.136
On reži,

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.376
napada me nadljudskom snagom.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.096
Rvemo se, tučemo,

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.016
uspevam da ga oborim

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.600
i stavim mu lisice.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.496
"Adolfe Hitleru", kažem,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.360
"Hapsim te zbog zločina
protiv čovečnosti."

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.976
Ova verzija fantazije se završava ovde
sa ordenom časti